  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsServerDefender_RealTimeProtectionDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka āwhina tēnei kia kitea, kia āraia te tāuta me te whakahaere a te pūmanawa kino i runga i tō pūrere.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_WDOErrorDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: I hē tētahi mea. Me ngana anō ā muri ake. 
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_WDODescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Karapa Tuimotu
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_WDOActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tērā pea ko ētahi pūmanawa kino he tino uaua ki te tango i tō RW. Ka taea e Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft (karapa tuimotu) te āwhina kia kitea ēnei kia tangohia hoki mā ngā tikanga tuma tino hōu rawa. Mā tēnei e tīmata anō tō RW, ā, ka 15 meneti pea te roa o tēnei. 
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_VirusDefinitionVersionDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tikanga pareketo:
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_UseWindowsDefender_ActionDescriptionUILocked:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka whakahaerehia tēnei parenga e tō kaiwhakahaere, ā, kua whakawhāititia e ia tō uru atu ki tēnei taupānga.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_UseWindowsDefender_ActionDescriptionSideBySide:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft te karapa auau tō pūrere mō ngā tuma. Whakakāngia te parenga Wā-tūturu hei pare i tō pūrere i mua i tētahi tuma.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_UseWindowsDefender_ActionDescriptionNotInstalled:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore e wātea ngā tautuhinga mō Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft. Kua tango utanga te taupānga mai i te tūmau.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_UseWindowsDefender_ActionDescriptionNotAdmin:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me noho koe i te kaiwhakahaere kia huri i ngā tautuhinga Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_UseWindowsDefender_ActionDescriptionNormal:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ko Haumarutanga Windows tō kāinga hei tiro hei whakahaere hoki i te haumarutanga me te hauora o tō pūrere.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_UseWindowsDefender_ActionDescriptionDisabledGP:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore e wātea ngā tautuhinga mō Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft. Ngā taupānga kua wetohia e tō kaiwhakahaere.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_UseWindowsDefender_ActionDescriptionDisabled3rdPart:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ngā tautuhinga mō Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft i te wātea nā te mea kei te weto. Haumarutanga Windows hei whakakā.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_UseWindowsDefenderDescriptionOpen:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Huaki Haumarutanga Windows
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_UseWindowsDefenderDescriptionOn:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakakāngia a Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_SpywareDefinitionVersionDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tikanga pūparetūtei:
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_SideBySide_RealTimeProtectionDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kua weto te parenga Wā-tūturu nō te mea he papatono ārai huaketo tāu. Wetetāutatia tō papatono patu huaketo onāianei hei whakakā i te parenga Wā-tūturu o Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_SideBySide_OnDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He auau tā te Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft karapa i tō pūrere mō ngā tuma, ā, ka whakamōhio i a koe mēnā ka kitea he tuma.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_SideBySide_OffDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ahakoa kei te whakamahi koe i tētahi atu papatono ārai pūmanawa kino, ka taea e Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft te karapa auau me te whakamōhio i a koe ki ngā tuma i tō pūrere.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_SampleSubmission_ToggleDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Te tāpae tauira aunoa
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_SampleSubmissionLink_Header:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tauākī Tūmataitinga
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_SampleSubmissionDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukuna a Pareketo Pūkaro Microsoft kia tuku tauira o ngā kōnae whakatūpato ki Microsoft, hei whakapai ake i te kitenga pūmanawa kino. Whakawetohia tēnei kia akina koe i mua i te tuku tauira ki Microsoft.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_RealTimeProtectionDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka āwhina ki te kimi me te aukati i ngā pūmanawa kino i te tāuta me te haere i runga i tō pūrere. Ka taea tēnei te whakaweto rangitahi e koe, engari ki te roa rawa e weto ana ka whakakā aunoatia anō e mātou.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_ProcessesDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ina aukati koe i tētahi tukanga, ka aukatia hoki tētahi kōnae i pāhono ki te tukanga.
  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_PC_Status:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tūnga RW:
