  \resources\SystemSettings_WindowsDefender_EnhancedNotificationsDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tuku ai Haumarutanga Windows i ētahi whakamōhiotanga hei whakapūmau i tō whiwhi whakamōhiotanga mō te hauora o tō pūrere. Ahakoa whakawetohia tēnei kōwhiringa, ka whiwhi whakamōhiotanga taketake mō ngā take me aronui inamata.
