  \resources\SystemSettings_SurfaceHub_LaunchEventViewerActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hei kite i ngā takahanga kua puta i tō Surface Hub, tīpakohia te pūtake, te rangitaki, te kōpuku tirohanga ritenga ake rānei ki te rākau papatohu. Kei roto i te tirohanga Takahanga ā-Kaiwhakahaere ngā takahanga katoa, ahakoa te pūtake.
