  \resources\SystemSettings_SurfaceHub_GetDomainAdministratorsGroup_Description_DomainJoined:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: E hono ana tēnei pūrere ki tētahi puni, ā, e whakahaerehia ana e tētahi rōpū haumarutanga.
  \resources\SystemSettings_SurfaceHub_GetDomainAdministratorsGroup_Description_CloudDomainJoined:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: E hono ana tēnei pūrere ki tētahi Azure Active Directory (Azure AD), ā, e whakahaerehia ana e ngā kaiwhakahaere i roto i tō umanga.
